      <item><![CDATA[README.md with detailed documentation]]></item>
      <item><![CDATA[index.html in each folder for security]]></item>
    </addition>
    <change>
      <item><![CDATA[MAJOR: Full migration to Joomla 5/6 architecture]]></item>
      <item><![CDATA[Updated helper.php with legacy wrapper for backwards compatibility]]></item>
      <item><![CDATA[Modernized code structure with PSR-12 compliance]]></item>
    </change>
    <fix>
      <item><![CDATA[Fixed &quot;Undefined array key 0&quot; warning in default.php for items without tags]]></item>
      <item><![CDATA[Fixed type handling for subform data in Dispatcher and Helper]]></item>
      <item><![CDATA[Improved robustness for stdClass to array conversion]]></item>
      <item><![CDATA[Changelog and language files updated]]></item>
    </fix>
    <note>
      <item><![CDATA[Now fully compatible with Joomla 5 &amp; 6 WITHOUT Compatibility Plugin]]></item>
      <item><![CDATA[Backwards compatible with Joomla 4.x]]></item>
    </note>
